OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 21-mile water pipe to
OL,4,Alink two reservoirs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-mile water pipe could be built to
OL,7,Fchannel water from a reservoir in
OL,8,FDerbyshire to a treatment works in
OL,9,FStaffordshire.
OL,11,FThe Severn Trent Water scheme would see
OL,12,Funtreated water moved from Carsington
OL,13,FWater, near Wirksworth, to its
OL,14,FTittesworth Reservoir treatment works
OL,15,Fnear Leek.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
