OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1791350805
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 21-mile water pipe to
OL,4,Alink two reservoirs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn environmental impact assessment for
OL,7,Fthe scheme, required ahead of a formal
OL,8,Fplanning application, has been
OL,9,Fsubmitted to the Peak District,
OL,10,FDerbyshire Dales, East Staffordshire
OL,11,Fand Staffordshire Moorlands
OL,12,Fauthorities.
OL,14,FThe development, which Severn Trent
OL,15,Fhopes will be ready to begin
OL,16,Fconstruction by spring 2027, would also
OL,17,Frequire "above-ground installations",
OL,18,Fsaid the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,19,FService.
